Adaptation 05-explicit-opt-in

Added here, not in the fork. statechart, the formal-verification pair and ketchup-video run only when
invoked by name; the statechart runner installs nothing. The thermos reviews run only by name. recall
reads chat history only on request, automate-me asks before mining transcripts and writes or opens a PR
only after approval, correct adds rules only in a requested run, reflect files backlog only with
authorization, get-pr-comments reads every page. Restores a worktree-cleanup safety line lost in a merge.

Fork source: https://github.com/mneves75/pstack-claude commits none (this repository).
Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

